data: {"id": "e8015ffc06e6449f-thinking-parallel_evidence-247", "run_id": "e8015ffc06e6449f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "收到代码预采集的 baseline 结果。先整理已有事实，然后执行计划中的 1、2（Kubernetes describe 和 YAML）并补上 Topology，以定位 ContainerCreating 的具体原因（镜像拉取失败 vs 卷挂载失败 vs 其他）。\n\n### 已有事实（baseline）\n- **Metrics (Prometheus)**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\"；`kube_pod_status_phase` Pending=1, Running=0；`restarts_total`=0。**确认当前仍然卡在 ContainerCreating，尚未恢复。**\n- **Logging (Elasticsearch)**：空 (coverage=empty)。容器未启动，预期无应用日志。\n- **Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo)**：空 (coverage=empty)，原因是 `pod_ip is empty`——容器未启动，", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788435729068, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

