data: {"id": "e8015ffc06e6449f-thinking-parallel_evidence-940", "run_id": "e8015ffc06e6449f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集关键事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`phase=Pending`，`ContainerCreating`（waiting reason），已持续约 127 分钟，**未恢复**。\n2. **Pod YAML**：\n   - 容器 `app` 使用镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，`imagePullPolicy=IfNotPresent`。\n   - **`imagePullSecrets: <absent>`**（无认证凭据）。\n   - **Pod 注解**：`k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`。\n   - 节点：`node2`，控制器：ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c` → Deployment `workload`。\n3. **Events（关键发现）**：\n   - `Warning NoNetworkFound` (repeated ~50+ 次)，消息：`cannot find", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788435746394, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

