data: {"id": "e8015ffc06e6449f-final", "run_id": "e8015ffc06e6449f", "seq": 945, "ts_ms": 1788435764191, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending, unable to start. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (46条记录, 跨度53m-6s) | 确认定性事实：Pod 依赖的 CNI 网络定义缺失，导致网络配置失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: plugin type=\"multus\" ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) ... not found` | 确认最终失败机制：Kubelet 因 Multus 报错而中止 Sandbox 创建 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 描述 Pod 当前停滞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 辅助验证容器当前确实处于 Waiting 状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n*   事件 `fact-7037c3e0f269` (6s 前) 与 `fact-a75152bec1ea` (4m21s 前) 构成了完整的因果证据链：Multus 持续找不到 `unavailable-network` (Event 1) 直接导致 Kubelet 创建 Sandbox 失败 (Event 2)。\n*   State 和 Metric 记录 (Row 3, 4) 一致表明 Pod 因上述网络配置错误一直停留在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 注解引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 找不到资源并抛出 NoNetworkFound 错误 → Kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 陷入 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 配置了 CNI 网络注解，要求使用名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络定义，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`）。这导致 Multus 插件初始化失败，进而使 kubelet 无法完成沙箱创建，引发持续等待（见证据 `fact-7037c3e0f269`、`fact-a75152bec1ea`、`fact-8b7bdab7a87b`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 46.4s (Evidence 38.3s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.644, "metrics": {"run_id": "e8015ffc06e6449f", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.64975786209106, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75649.75786209106, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 65303.08175086975, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 21215.65008163452, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9914.385795593262}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19649.307012557983, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 46365.18883705139, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9613.787174224854, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

